                    sling:resourceType="wcm/foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;>&lt;u>&lt;b>Introduction&lt;/b>:&lt;/u>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;An eligible 12-month employee can request to participate in a 10/12 or 11/12 Pay Plan based on the respective Collective Bargaining Agreement (CBA). An individual will receive an annual salary for working &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;10 months or 11 months, depending on the Pay Plan, in 12 (twelve) salary warrants. Please read your CBA or contact Human Resource Services if you have any questions.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;>&lt;b>&lt;u>Instructions&lt;/u>&lt;/b>:&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Complete this form in the order indicated. Please indicate the effective date and the month(s) off.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>The effective date should be the beginning of a pay period.&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Your appropriate administrator will recommend and approve your request. The form will then be forwarded to Human Resource Services.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Human Resource Services will notify the employee and the department with the new monthly salary based on the Pay Plan. At this time, the employee may elect to confirm or rescind this request.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;>&lt;b>&lt;u>Cancellation:&lt;/u>&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To terminate your 10/12 or 11/12 Pay Plan, this form should be completed. The University may also cancel your Pay Plan due to program needs and according to the respective CBA.&lt;/p>"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
            </responsivegrid_436751876>
